{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d9f581207331fc552078530d152deff7c9831d3ad7cdb96f07dbba4560c1f151", "ja": "（伊織と歌織さんと、コンセプト写真集のロケにきた。\n南の島での撮影も順調で、二人とも楽しそうだったな）", "zh": "（我和伊织、歌织小姐一起来拍摄概念写真集。南方小岛的拍摄也很顺利，两个人看起来都很开心。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "d261b32516ae3bda9169343b8c8764fe55caaccb33d194cc3f63a23a4975f265", "ja": "きゃ～～～～！！", "zh": "呀～～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1002_p", "source_sha256": "55592eda4fee1e0392fec578329307843709ee506c2e5baeb61cbc549f1b0bc1", "ja": "え！？　今の声は……伊織？\n大丈夫か！？", "zh": "诶！？刚才的声音是……伊织？\n没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "74dbf49fbe545ea81ff38d89050462cd37f36a5d0e1f44106152e4c82d323ae4", "ja": "早く拾わなきゃ、波にさらわれちゃうわ。\nもう、いくらなんでも採りすぎよ、歌織ったら。", "zh": "得赶紧捡起来，不然要被海浪冲走了。\n真是的，歌织也太贪心了，居然采了这么多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "bcbce6001643a1b15c9c12d6cee6a98f5735a8fcc8f38bd2d6cf6e569ba48a6b", "ja": "やっぱり、欲張りすぎたかしら？　それにしても……\nふふっ。伊織ちゃんも、運びきれない量ね。", "zh": "果然还是太贪心了吧？不过话说回来……呵呵，伊织也弄了这么多，根本搬不完呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "4a3efe489b162e8a84fd7ce22c833a4ec82b9c167e6ae23a40816077e63727fc", "ja": "当然じゃない♪　この伊織ちゃんが釣りをするのよ、\n一匹や二匹で収まるわけないでしょ。", "zh": "那是当然的啦♪ 既然是我伊织去钓鱼，\n怎么可能只钓个一两尾就收手嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1006_p", "source_sha256": "584a34309ddb663d9c394da18be07cd5fb18b8647854fa30b288c747bff75b09", "ja": "……すごい量の魚が……。", "zh": "……好大一堆鱼啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "100ea4cff1d1ac95dc5c3a6b6adce96d3730351ee476452799a8960e070102ad", "ja": "あら、{$P$}、いいところに\n来たじゃない。ちょうど手が欲しかったところよ。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}，你来得正好。正好需要人手呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e4005506994a8146f6f3aa750d79a0818f807e6845c8f987a629305d06e9ecb7", "ja": "すごいな伊織。すっかり釣りのコツを\nつかんだみたいだな。", "zh": "真厉害啊，伊织。看来你已经完全掌握钓鱼的诀窍了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "c3e913d86f2cf9d9ec92cf77a9bad79aaec2333b7479e8201e68b95bcc02deba", "ja": "だって、魚のほうから寄ってくるんだもの♪\n伊織ちゃんの魅力は、お魚もメロメロにしちゃうのね。", "zh": "毕竟，鱼都主动靠过来了嘛♪\n伊织的魅力，连鱼儿都为之倾倒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "c557256ede73fa3ed8899e3d18f033679ce32db3b36680a118826fd4e4f8700a", "ja": "この後の撮影も期待していいわよ。海の中で魚と戯れる\nスーパーアイドル。最高にいい絵になるんだから！", "zh": "接下来的拍摄也尽管期待吧。和鱼儿在海中嬉戏的超级偶像，一定能拍出最棒的画面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1011_p", "source_sha256": "67dbae871a75aa8237ad74526db948cbea1ed668ed9aeb3a42cc55c4add32a9f", "ja": "（釣ってるけど……）", "zh": "（虽然是在钓鱼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1012_p", "source_sha256": "50af671ff694173626a7197401da57a85b15c7576e20d7d4618660b3d4aa97e3", "ja": "歌織さんも、ずいぶん果物を採りましたね。\n1、2、3……とにかく！　いっぱいですね！", "zh": "歌织也采了不少水果呢。\n1、2、3……总之！好多啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "bbb62d09ca21e19f133572f137ad813db4d01693f981d24dd4efb5b31f952b9a", "ja": "ええ。私達で楽しむのもなんですし、\nスタッフさん達の分もと思っていたら……こんなに♪", "zh": "是啊。光是我们享用也不太好，所以想着也给工作人员们准备一些……没想到就摘了这么多♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "b6bdd2b4adaf24dbefc837fa834547fd747810b2c1ef38b38542d3bd11515971", "ja": "よかったら、{$P$}さんも\nあとで召し上がりませんか？", "zh": "如果不介意的话，{$P$}先生\n待会儿也来尝尝看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1015_p", "source_sha256": "58f198f39f24ebe1529de6858dae4649b4125e4cc63cc2e6adf8b66408795641", "ja": "ありがとうございます。それじゃ、有難く。", "zh": "谢谢。那我就不客气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "6fbe84c9e829aa842194ff51828be7662c1ae3856f7cda83a5c554028813aabb", "ja": "ほら、いつまでボーっとしてるつもり？　ここにある\n魚と果物、アンタが運ぶのよ！", "zh": "喂，你还打算发呆到什么时候？这里的鱼和水果，都由你来搬！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "c4f1d60933205edfdd578074c3643b443633550e547cdf32f316a4f0fc2af534", "ja": "あ、ついでにこの釣り具も片付けておいてね♪\n私たち、忙しいんだから。", "zh": "啊，顺便把这些钓鱼用具也收拾好哦♪\n我们可是很忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1018_p", "source_sha256": "13cc98726656ae7833e6a54b9413351b85918d3e85d9aca97f86968f54741eb9", "ja": "いいけど……どこに行くんだ？\nもうすぐ休憩も終わるぞ？", "zh": "行倒是行……不过你们要去哪？\n休息时间马上就要结束了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "58816d7e56702dd19871cc2475c0f9d7e7ca8c85f872f7f0673a242f9378d0df", "ja": "だからじゃない。軽く波の様子と、風向きも\nチェックしておきたいの。", "zh": "不是因为那个啦。我想先简单确认一下海浪的情况，还有风向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0404_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "e25c08924db679a9ced429addfc19f332dd1a410b707ae470ee72e86080e1fdb", "ja": "この伊織ちゃんの写真集なんだから、とびきりの画を\n見せなくちゃ。期待してなさいよね♪", "zh": "既然是本伊织的写真集，就得给你们看看最精彩的画面。好好期待吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
